      "summary": "Author a new on-device skill on user request: confirm metadata, draft markdown skeleton, write_file to /fatfs/skills/<id>.md, then register_skill into skills_list.json so future similar requests resolve through activate_skill. Lets ESP-Claw evolve its long-term capabilities locally. Only invoke when the user explicitly asks to save, create, or teach a new skill.",
